    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d389">

                <pb facs="0577" n="563" sameAs="frus:frus1949v07p1/pg563"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">501.BC Indonesia/11–449: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            Embassy in the Netherlands
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-11-04T13:00:00-05:00">November 4, 1949—1
                            p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>982. Ushic 46. Ur 634 July 27.<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d389-f1"/> Wld it not be desirable for you solicit Hatta’s views on
                    desirability IMF mission to Indo. It occurs to <pb facs="0578" n="564"
                        xml:id="pg564"/>
                    Dept presence such mission in Indo might be extremely helpful in connection
                    monetary and currency reforms which Indo Govt
                    must undertake in near future.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
